## 3. CODE STYLE & CONVENTIONS

### Import Order

```typescript
// 1. React & Next.js
import { useState, useEffect } from "react";
import { useRouter } from "next/navigation";

// 2. Third-party libraries
import { Loader2, ArrowLeft } from "lucide-react";
import toast from "react-hot-toast";

// 3. Local components & utilities (use @ alias)
import ChatInterface from "@/components/ChatInterface";
import { db } from "@/lib/db";
import { getOrCreateSession } from "@/lib/analytics";

// 4. Types (use 'type' keyword)
import type { ChatStats, Session } from "./types/dashboard.types";

// 5. Relative imports (only for co-located files)
import StatsCard from "./shared/StatsCard";
```

### Naming Conventions

```
Components:          PascalCase.tsx        ChatInterface.tsx
Utilities/Libraries: camelCase.ts          analytics.ts
API Routes:          kebab-case/route.ts   app/api/chat-config/route.ts
Hooks:               useCamelCase.ts       useTypewriter.ts
Database tables:     snake_case            chat_sessions
Database fields:     camelCase             chatName, createdAt
```

### Tailwind CSS Usage

**Mobile-First Responsive Design:**
```typescript
// ✅ Good: Mobile-first with responsive breakpoints
<div className="w-full md:w-1/2 lg:w-1/3 xl:w-1/4">
<div className="text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg">
<div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">

// ✅ Good: CSS variables for dynamic theming
<div style={{
  backgroundColor: "var(--color-primary)",
  color: "var(--color-surface)"
}}>

// ❌ Avoid: Inline styles (use Tailwind utilities)
<div style={{ padding: "20px", margin: "10px" }}>  // Use p-5 m-2.5
```

**Conditional Classes:**
```typescript
// ✅ Good: Template literals for dynamic classes
<div className={`flex ${
  message.role === "user" ? "justify-end" : "justify-start"
}`}>

// ✅ Good: Multiple conditions
<div className={`
  px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl
  ${message.role === "user" ? "bg-blue-500 text-white" : "bg-gray-100"}
  ${loading ? "opacity-50" : ""}
`}>
```

